{"id":"a6b9b6494187f1b0","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-jonsson.md","title":"Jónsson Cardinal","display":"df-jonsson — Jónsson Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jonsson","aliases":["58-df-jonsson"],"display":"df-jonsson — Jónsson Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jonsson"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jonsson</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jonsson — Jónsson Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md\">../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cardinal parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (cardinal and Jónsson-cardinal predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-function predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset.md\">58-df-finite-subset.md</a> 的有限子集记号。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson} \\vdash \\mathrm{Jonsson}(\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\\exists H\\subsetneq\\kappa\\;\\left(|H|=\\kappa\\land f[[H]^{&lt;\\omega}]\\subseteq H\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson} \\vdash \\mathrm{Jonsson}(\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\\exists H\\subsetneq\\kappa\\;\\left(|H|=\\kappa\\land f[[H]^{&lt;\\omega}]\\subseteq H\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Jónsson cardinal cannot be partitioned into fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> many pieces using finite subsets.</li>\n<li>The definition requires a proper <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>-closed subset of size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> for every finitary operation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-finite-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ (cardinal parameter, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"130f2eb9510d97cd","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，采用 [[58-df-finite-subset.md]] 的有限子集记号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson} \\vdash \\mathrm{Jonsson}(\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(f,[\\kappa]^{<\\omega},\\kappa)\\to\\exists H\\subsetneq\\kappa\\;\\left(|H|=\\kappa\\land f[[H]^{<\\omega}]\\subseteq H\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1402,"backlinks":[{"id":"525e9ee4487a8fee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Jonsson}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-jonsson]] and [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-721","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-jonsson.md|58-df-jonsson]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751","2be08d4ee8aa1590","130f2eb9510d97cd"]}